cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the heterogeneous spatiotemporal GARCH
  methodology in your research, please cite the arXiv paper below.
type: software
title: "Heterogeneous Spatiotemporal GARCH: Reproducibility Code"
authors:
  - family-names: Aouri
    given-names: Atika
  - family-names: Otto
    given-names: Philipp
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R code for heterogeneous spatiotemporal GARCH models,
  including spatial estimation, volatility prediction, simulations,
  and applications to air pollution and financial data.
keywords:
  - spatiotemporal GARCH
  - volatility prediction
  - spatial statistics
  - reproducible research
  - R
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    A Heterogeneous Spatiotemporal GARCH Model: A Predictive Framework
    for Volatility in Financial Networks
  authors:
